From a04befe62113bb0bc57af158c837275ea7947a9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:53:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/27] Typer: abstractstrict (Self.X is only equal to a
 selection through the same witness); corrections to eqindex and eqeager from
 the design review

eqindex: not when a given or the goal is a type alias at its root.
eqeager: a search that runs past the depth bound ends silently when it exceeds
the budget; only givens on the stack disable it; summon.depthExhausted counts
resolutions that ended without result because of the bound.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CH6tJP7hLkrpGFxEq7K6r
